- *
- * mask-image aliases (VitaSurf addition). The mask-image parser itself is
- * generated from properties.gen; -webkit-mask-image, which stylesheets
- * still ship alongside the unprefixed property, produces the same bytecode.
+ * Copyright 2010 The NetSurf Browser Project.
